"{\n  \"entities\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Renewable Energy\",\n      \"type\": \"Energy Source\",\n      \"description\": \"Renewable energy sources are sustainable and environmentally friendly alternatives to fossil fuels, providing a path towards a cleaner, greener, and more sustainable world for generations to come.\",\n      \"attributes\": {\n        \"Impact\": \"Reduces carbon emissions and environmental impact\",\n        \"Future Outlook\": \"Promising and bright, with ongoing research and development driving innovation and efficiency improvements\",\n        \"Role in Energy Needs\": \"Poised to play a significant role in meeting the world\\\"s growing energy needs\",\n        \"Types\": \"Hydropower, solar power, wind power, geothermal energy, bioenergy, and biofuels\",\n        \"Public Perception\": \"Gaining momentum and increased public awareness\",\n        \"Economic Factors\": \"Decreasing costs, especially for solar panels, making it more accessible to homeowners and businesses\",\n        \"Technological Advancements\": \"Improvements in efficiency and effectiveness, such as thin-film solar cells, solar tracking systems, and advancements in wind turbine technology\",\n        \"Policy Support\": \"Essential for continued growth, including renewable energy targets, subsidies, and carbon pricing mechanisms\",\n        \"Global Efforts\": \"Driven by international agreements like the Paris Agreement to reduce greenhouse gas emissions and mitigate climate change impacts\",\n        \"Grid Integration\": \"Optimized by smart grid technologies and energy storage solutions, addressing the intermittent nature of some sources\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"air pollution\",\n      \"type\": \"Environmental Issue\",\n      \"description\": \"Air pollution is a significant environmental concern that involves the release of pollutants into the atmosphere, affecting air quality and contributing to various health and environmental problems.\