tion\": \"Solar power generation is the process of converting sunlight into electricity using various technologies, including thin-film solar cells and solar tracking systems, which have significantly improved its efficiency and effectiveness.\",\n      \"attributes\": {\n        \"Improvements\": \"Advancements in thin-film solar cells and solar tracking systems\",\n        \"Efficiency\": \"Improved\",\n        \"Effectiveness\": \"Enhanced\",\n        \"Technology Type\": \"Renewable Energy\",\n        \"Prominence\": \"One of the most promising renewable energy sources\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"plants\",\n      \"type\": \"Organic Material\",\n      \"description\": \"Plants are organic materials that can be used as a source for bioenergy, contributing to renewable energy resources.\",\n      \"attributes\": {\n        \"Type\": \"Organic Material\",\n        \"Usage\": \"Source for Bioenergy\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"solar\",\n      \"type\": \"Renewable Energy Source\",\n      \"description\": \"Solar energy is a renewable energy source that harnesses the power of the sun to generate electricity, becoming increasingly accessible and cost-effective due to technological advancements and policy support.\",\n      \"attributes\": {\n        \"Cost Trend\": \"Steadily Decreasing\",\n        \"Accessibility\": \"Increasingly Accessible to Homeowners and Businesses\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Hydropower\",\n      \"type\": \"Energy Source\",\n      \"description\": \"Energy derived from the movement of water, including large-scale and smaller-scale projects that aim to minimize environmental disruption.\",\n      \"attributes\": {}\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Solar Power\",\n      \"type\": \"Energy Source\",\n      \"description\": \"Energy harnessed from the sun and converted into electricity, with advancements in technology improving efficiency and effectiveness.\",\n      \"attributes\": {}\n    },\n   